<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico completes credit auctions.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico completes credit auctions.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico placed 4.754 billion pesos in the secondary market on Wednesday through three credit auctions, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were assigned as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM	AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    1.877 bln  13 days   25.49 pct</p>
<p>    1.877 bln  12 days   25.48 pct</p>
<p>    1.000 bln   1 day    24.76 pct</p>
<p>-- Mexico City Newsroom 525 728-9559</p>
</text>
